OL,3,APolice searching for mum of baby girl
OL,4,Afound on shoreline tell her not to be
OL,5,Aafraid to call
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice searching for the mother of a
OL,8,Fnewborn baby girl whose body was found
OL,9,Fon a north Wales shoreline have set up
OL,10,Fa special phone line, urging her to
OL,11,Fcontact them.
OL,13,FA member of the public found the body
OL,14,Fon the Menai Strait shoreline near
OL,15,FSiliwen Road in Bangor, Gwynedd, on
OL,16,FSunday shortly before 17:00 BST.
OL,18,FIn an update on Thursday, North Wales
OL,19,FPolice said a post-mortem examination
OL,20,Frevealed the newborn was a girl, adding
OL,21,Fthat she may have been in the water for
OL,22,Fup to a few weeks.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
